muew-preset 2
name Sub Lead
category Lead
author MUEW Factory
tags mono fat warm dark
desc Fat square lead with a square sub an octave below. Great for low melodies.
osc1Shape 3
osc2Shape 2
osc2Detune -12
osc2Level 0.3
filterCutoff 2200
filterReso 0.4
filterMode 0
amp 0.005 0.3 0.9 0.2
mod 0.005 0.4 0.2 0.2
lfo1Rate 5
lfo1Shape 0
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 0 0
warp2 0 0
mseg 1 0 4 0 0 0.15 1 0.55 -0.3 1 0
unison 1 1 0.1 0.1 0.5 0.7
sub 0.5 1 2
routes 7
route 1 2 1.2
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 0 0.28 0.42 0.35 0.22
reverb 0 0.55 0.45 0.28
comp 1 0.4
